stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> ResearcherAgent
    ResearcherAgent --> RiskAnalystAgent: Raw Graph & Vector Context
    RiskAnalystAgent --> CriticAgent: Draft Exposure & Stoppage Report
    state CriticAgent {
        [*] --> CheckLogic
        CheckLogic --> CheckMath
        CheckMath --> HallucinationGuard
    }
    CriticAgent --> RiskAnalystAgent: Feedback Loop (If Validation Fails)
    CriticAgent --> HumanInTheLoop: Approved & Verified Report
    HumanInTheLoop --> [*]: User Approval / SAP BAPI Call